// // The AH3() typecast to 16-bit float is a NO-OP, the compiler pattern matches and uses D16 opcode support instead.
// AH3 CasLoadH(ASW2 p){return AH3(imageLoad(imgSrc,ASU2(p)).rgb);}
// ...
